    <!-- Help -->
    <string name="help_title">How to use Vmore</string>
    <string name="help_body">Vmore is a downloader and uploader that runs entirely on this phone.\n\n1. Sign in once with your Telegram number and the login code. Nothing is sent to any server.\n2. Paste a Telegram link on the home screen. Private links (t.me/c/…) work with your own account.\n3. Choose the chat that should receive the files.\n4. Tap Start. Vmore downloads the media and uploads it to that chat with your own data.\n\nRanges and batches: a range link such as t.me/channel/1-500 becomes one job per message, so a whole album or a whole channel section can be moved in one go.\n\nQuality: sending as File keeps the original bytes. Video plays inline. Photo is a fast preview.\n\nStorage: when Delete local copy is on, the phone copy is removed right after a successful upload and the job moves on to the next one.\n\nAll of this happens again by itself if the app is closed, because the queue runs as a foreground service.</string>

